OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 12 JAN
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GKatie Derham is joined by
OL,6,     Gviolinist Roman Mints for a live
OL,7,     Gperformance in studio, linked to
OL,8,     GLondon's Another Music Festival:
OL,9,     GDisplaced - which Roman curates.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical music by
OL,13,     GGjeilo, Brahms, and Mangore.
OL,14,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,15,     GThe Minnesota Orchestra is joined
OL,16,     Gby star pianist Bruce Liu for
OL,17,     GProkofiev's dazzling 3rd Concerto
OL,18,     Gand the orchestra revels in
OL,19,     GRachmaninov's Symphonic Dances.
